<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <VersionPrefix>1.6.0-beta8</VersionPrefix>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>* Built against [Akka.NET 1.6.0-beta8](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/releases/tag/1.6.0-beta8) and Akka.Hosting 1.6.0-beta8 - [#569](https://github.com/petabridge/Akka.Persistence.Azure/pull/569)
* [Fix `AzureBlobSnapshotStore` listing the snapshots of other persistence ids](https://github.com/petabridge/Akka.Persistence.Azure/pull/575)
* Update the Azure SDK packages - [#568](https://github.com/petabridge/Akka.Persistence.Azure/pull/568)

**Bug Fixes:**

Includes the snapshot listing fix from 1.5.75. The listing for `customer-9` no longer returns the snapshots of `customer-90`, `customer-91` and so on, which could make `LoadAsync` time out when many persistence ids started with the same text. See the 1.5.75 notes below.

**Dependency changes:**

* `Azure.Storage.Blobs` 12.23.0 to 12.30.1, `Azure.Data.Tables` 12.10.0 to 12.13.0, `Azure.Identity` 1.13.2 to 1.21.0, and `Microsoft.Identity.Client` 4.73.1 to 4.92.0.

No public API or storage format changes.</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>